ut intense combat experience. his game would be perfect if you want to &quot;relax&quot; and shoot some bad guys for a 15 minutes or so while waiting for your AAA-blockbuster to download. But if you a hardcore gamer, you will be lost in this game. Fight for high score, unlock every upgrade, reveal each hidden mechanic and be the very best. I really hope you will like this game!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1318550/extras/d05a978a409b64177b0384c96af0e609.poster.avif?t=1640360312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1318550/extras/d05a978a409b64177b0384c96af0e609.webm?t=1640360312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1318550/extras/d05a978a409b64177b0384c96af0e609.mp4?t=1640360312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
